{"unit_id":"ximengxiaolan__dsh-vision-bridge#card-zh","repo":"ximengxiaolan/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"55bbd9bfc5889b8dc8a01bdbb18dc814cf983357","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-bridge 是面向 DSH Web 的图片理解插件，让 DeepSeek 等纯文本模型也能处理粘贴图片。发送请求前，它会把图片交给配置的 OpenAI 兼容视觉模型生成描述，并替换模型请求中的图片；原生支持图片的模型保留原图。插件会缓存重复附件的描述，识别失败时以失败说明继续对话。使用前需配置视觉模型 API Key、服务地址和模型名称。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45-67","lib/index.js:69-126","lib/index.js:152-195"]}
{"unit_id":"ximengxiaolan__dsh-vision-bridge#card-en","repo":"ximengxiaolan/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"55bbd9bfc5889b8dc8a01bdbb18dc814cf983357","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-vision-bridge lets text-only models understand images pasted in DSH Web. It sends images to a configured vision API and replaces them with descriptions. Image-capable models keep originals. Descriptions are cached; failures do not stop the conversation. Configure an API key, endpoint, and model.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:45-67","lib/index.js:69-126","lib/index.js:152-195"]}
