{"unit_id":"ximengxiaolan__dsh-vision-bridge#feature-1","repo":"ximengxiaolan/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"55bbd9bfc5889b8dc8a01bdbb18dc814cf983357","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-bridge 的功能「图片转文字」：向纯文本模型发送请求前，将图片附件交给配置的视觉模型生成描述，并以文本块替换图片内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:128-149","lib/index.js:152-175"]}
