{"unit_id":"ximengxiaolan__dsh-vision-bridge#feature-3","repo":"ximengxiaolan/dsh-vision-bridge","commit":"55bbd9bfc5889b8dc8a01bdbb18dc814cf983357","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-bridge 的功能「重复描述缓存」：按附件 ID 在进程内缓存图片描述，并限制缓存最多保留 256 项，避免重复发送同一附件时重复请求视觉模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:52-77"]}
